  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calc</h1>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"left\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"right\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <div class=\"result-row\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">0</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"app.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: 4px solid var(--accent);\n  padding: 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 360px;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 20px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.row {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  background: #0f1626;\n  border: 2px solid var(--muted);\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  outline: 2px solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 1px;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  transition: transform 0.1s, filter 0.15s;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { filter: brightness(1.15); }\nbutton:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #fff; outline-offset: 2px; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); filter: brightness(0.85); }\n\n.result-row {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-top: 20px;\n  padding-top: 16px;\n  border-top: 2px dashed var(--muted);\n}\n\n.result-label {\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\noutput {\n  font-size: 22px;\n  font-weight: bold;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "app.js",
      "content": "const leftInput = document.getElementById('left');\nconst rightInput = document.getElementById('right');\nconst operationSelect = document.getElementById('operation');\nconst calculateBtn = document.getElementById('calculate');\nconst resultOutput = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction compute() {\n  const leftRaw = leftInput.value.trim();\n  const rightRaw = rightInput.value.trim();\n  const left = parseFloat(leftRaw);\n  const right = parseFloat(rightRaw);\n\n  if (leftRaw === '' || rightRaw === '' || !Number.isFinite(left) || !Number.isFinite(right)) {\n    resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let result;\n  switch (operationSelect.value) {\n    case 'add': result = left + right; break;\n    case 'subtract': result = left - right; break;\n    case 'multiply': result = left * right; break;\n    case 'divide':\n      if (right === 0) { resultOutput.textContent = 'Error'; return; }\n      result = left / right;\n      break;\n    default:\n      resultOutput.textContent = 'Error';\n      return;\n  }\n\n  resultOutput.textContent = Number.isFinite(result) ? String(result) : 'Error';\n}\n\ncalculateBtn.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n[leftInput, rightInput, operationSelect].forEach(el => {\n  el.addEventListener('keydown', e => {\n    if (e.key === 'Enter') compute();\n  });\n});\n",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nAn offline, pixel-styled calculator built with plain HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. No packages, no network, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in **Left** and **Right** (negative values supported).\n3. Choose an **Operation**: Add, Subtract, Multiply, or Divide.\n4. Click **Calculate** or press **Enter** in any field.\n5. The numeric result appears next to **Result**. The initial value is `0`.\n\n## Error Handling\n\nThe output shows exactly `Error` when:\n- Either input is empty or contains a non-finite value (e.g. `abc`, `Infinity`).\n- Division by zero is attempted.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All inputs and the select have associated `<label>` elements.\n- The button is keyboard-focusable with visible focus, hover, and pressed states.\n- The result uses `aria-live=\"polite\"` for screen reader announcements.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and required IDs (`left`, `right`, `operation`, `calculate`, `result`).\n- `styles.css` — pixel palette, blocky borders, responsive layout down to 360px.\n- `app.js` — arithmetic and validation logic.\n\n## Palette\n\n- Background `#1a1a2e`\n- Card `#16213e`\n- Accent `#e94560`\n- Text `#f0f0f0`\n- Muted `#a0a0b0`\n",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
